	(text "NSI6651 inputs, AHCT, sensors, references, PC +5V, gate bias of phases 1-2. ctrl_c2000 circuit (SNVSC40E table 9-1, 400 kHz / 5 V / 2 A): 15 uH, 3 x 22 uF, RT 64.9k,\nFB 100k / 24.9k 0.1 % -> 4.93-5.10 V. Load in design_check (<= 80 % of 2 A)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 85.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1233b7f5-3485-5aaf-a0f5-443dd4bc7c92")
	)
	(text "PG_5VG low (+5V_GD < 90-94 %, i.e. the live 24 V is gone) disables the TPS62130 and lets the 100k from +24V\n(10 V Zener) turn on PMV30ENEA + 1.2R: +3V3 falls at >= 20 mV/us through the BOR region (F28003x SRVDDIO-DN)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 209.824 221.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1932ddb2-709b-5cfc-b11c-5d2c2fedaa0b")
	)
	(text "AUX-T1 reinforced winding SELV_24V / SELV_0V, cross-regulated 21.4-30.1 V (aux75_spec); full fan speed needs\n24.5 V. Full fan speed is only guaranteed while the converter is switching. Fan buck (12-36 V in) + SELV logic on the control board;\n>= 10 mm from live copper; nothing else of the SELV domain is on this board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 260.22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3d3a94a5-36d9-5a44-a7c1-5cde504c132b")
	)
	(text "gate bias of legs b and c, +3V3 (TPS62130). ctrl_c2000 circuit (SNVSC40E table 9-1, 400 kHz / 5 V / 2 A): 15 uH, 3 x 22 uF, RT 64.9k,\nFB 100k / 24.9k 0.1 % -> 4.93-5.10 V. Load in design_check (<= 80 % of 2 A)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 157.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3e942890-ac0b-5dc5-8244-881ee8c199d4")
	)
